# mindsos_cli test-stage dependencies (Phase 01).
# Includes everything in requirements.in plus pytest and friends.
# Used only by the `test` Docker stage; the `prod` stage installs requirements.txt only.
#
# Phase 01 additions:
#   - PyYAML       — tests/phase_01/test_workflows_present.py parses workflow YAML.
#
# NOTE: requirements.in (runtime) is unchanged in Phase 01, so the manifest's
# requirements_txt_sha256 stays the same. requirements-test.txt regenerates
# — re-run tools/lock.sh once on the tester's Linux box and commit the resulting
# requirements-test.txt before pushing the phase-01 branch.

-r requirements.in

